{"id":43823614896654,"type":"album","name":"Make Yourself","artist":"Incubus","year":1999,"weight":10,"info":{"cover":"https://dn710908.ca.archive.org/0/items/mbid-00d1109d-6954-3791-8193-c29fdc28bf30/mbid-00d1109d-6954-3791-8193-c29fdc28bf30-23589283839.png","kind":"Album","tracks":13,"country":"XE","yt":"hykMfx1OP8Y","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/incubus/make-yourself"},"desc":"Make Yourself is the third album by American rock band Incubus, released through Immortal Records on October 26th, 1999. The album has been certified double platinum in the United States along with featuring three charting singles, \"Pardon Me\", \"Stellar\", and \"Drive\", all of which reached the top three of the Billboard Modern Rock Tracks chart. This album saw the beginning of the band's stylistic shift from the metal & funk of previous albums into a more melodic, groove-oriented alternative rock approach. This is apparent in the lack of slap bass and guitar palm muting, which can only slightly be found ."},"artist_ref":{"id":145264067026848,"name":"Incubus","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":210192360016800,"type":"genre","name":"Alternative Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":2664,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":8412226417108,"type":"genre","name":"Indie Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1139,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":174164112458259,"type":"genre","name":"Heavy Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":782,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":270478598006331,"type":"genre","name":"Alternative Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":293,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":18640217511367,"type":"genre","name":"Nu Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":254,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":229186194430618,"type":"genre","name":"Funk Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":238,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"}],"lists":[{"id":192934750972716,"name":"1001 Albums You Must Hear Before You Die","src":"charts","grp":"1001 Al